@baseUrl = http://127.0.0.1:3001
@inquiryId = replace-with-draft-id
@confirmationToken = replace-with-draft-confirmationToken
@adminSession = replace-with-management-session-cookie

### Fuzzy full-catalog search: vector / keyword UNION, not an AND filter
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/knowledge/search
Content-Type: application/json

{"locale":"zh","query":"我想要一个 K10 的板子或者是红外镜头的目镜"}

### English alternative components
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/knowledge/search
Content-Type: application/json

{"locale":"en","query":"K10 board or infrared eyepiece"}

### Gas imaging is part of the same catalog search
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/knowledge/search
Content-Type: application/json

{"locale":"zh","query":"气体成像"}

### Compare 2-12 published products; no prices, internal product details
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/knowledge/compare
Content-Type: application/json

{"locale":"zh","productSlugs":["gla07512k-t2-itz1212ip-imaging-kit","fluke-ti-eyepiece","guide-sensmart-pv400","flir-gf77"]}

### Retained extractive answer API; no longer part of the public search UI
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/knowledge/answer
Content-Type: application/json

{"locale":"zh","question":"PV400 的红外分辨率是多少？","productSlugs":["guide-sensmart-pv400"]}

### MUTATING: create a 30-minute preview; handwritten query + requirements <= 1000 characters
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/knowledge/inquiries/draft
Content-Type: application/json

{"locale":"zh","query":"K10 板子或目镜","requirements":"请工作人员确认所选产品的配置与交期。","productSlugs":["gla07512k-t2-itz1212ip-imaging-kit","fluke-ti-eyepiece"]}

### MUTATING: sends REAL EMAIL when confirmed=true; name and email <= 100 characters
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/knowledge/inquiries/{{inquiryId}}/confirm
Content-Type: application/json

{"confirmationToken":"{{confirmationToken}}","confirmed":false,"name":"Your name","email":"your-address@example.invalid"}

### Private inquiry inbox: management authentication required
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/knowledge/admin/inquiries
Cookie: cooyue_admin_session={{adminSession}}
